      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "paq_02",
      "text": "When I am feeling bad (feeling an unpleasant emotion), I can't tell whether I'm sad, angry, or scared.",
