      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "paq_03",
      "text": "When I am feeling bad (feeling an unpleasant emotion), I am not sure what exactly is making me feel that way.",
